  "final_answer": "I found the answer on Apple's trade-in page.\n\n## Trade-in Value for iPhone 13 Pro Max\n\nAccording to Apple's Trade-In program (apple.com/shop/trade-in), the estimated trade-in value for an **iPhone 13 Pro Max in good condition** is:\n\n### **Up to $320**\n\n**Important notes from Apple's page:**\n- Trade-in values vary based on the condition, year, and configuration of the device.\n- Not all devices are eligible for credit.\n- The \"Up to $320\" figure represents the maximum value awarded for a device in good working condition. Actual value is based on receipt of a qualifying device matching the description provided.\n- The trade-in value may be applied toward a new device purchase or added to an Apple Gift Card.\n- You must be at least the age of majority to be eligible to trade in for credit.\n\nFor comparison, some neighboring iPhone trade-in values on Apple's site:\n- iPhone 14 Pro Max: Up to $360\n- iPhone 13 Pro: Up to $255\n- iPhone 13: Up to $175\n- iPhone 13 mini: Up to $145\n- iPhone 12 Pro Max: Up to $210",
